+S:	Supported
+F:	drivers/gpu/drm/arc/arc-dw-hdmi.c
+F:	Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/bridge/snps,arc-dw-hdmi.txt
+
 ARCNET NETWORK LAYER
 M:	Michael Grzeschik <m.grzeschik@pengutronix.de>
 L:	netdev@vger.kernel.org
